--   WZ   NOT COVERABLE, by design.
        WZ compares the ids that produced a verdict against the declared list. Every
        check() in check-wire-facts.mjs is an unconditional top-level statement, so
        no input can stop one running: it is a regression guard on the checker
        source, not a check on the observation.

